# The server compiles a bundle's __tests__ folder as component code and rejects real Jest tests (LWC1503).
**/__tests__/**
# jsconfig.json is created by the Salesforce Extensions for VS Code; it is editor config and must not deploy.
**/jsconfig.json
# .eslintrc.json is shipped by `sf project generate` templates; it is lint config and must not deploy.
**/.eslintrc.json
